 "description": "Rename one existing workflow tag while preserving its ID and assignments. tagId is the stable selector from n8n_tags_list or get; name is the complete new display label, not another ID. Duplicate-name acceptance belongs to n8n. Use n8n_tags_create for a new label and n8n_workflows_update_tags to change assignments. Requires write/unsafe mode plus tag-update permission; returns validated metadata.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
